{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"2285550","name":"多洛可小镇","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《多洛可小镇》是一款末日废土世界观下的横版像素模拟经营游戏。在游戏中，玩家将扮演一位在末世废土探索生存的拾荒萌妹，在敌人追击下阴差阳错来到名为多洛可的小镇，从零打造梦想中的农场！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/55217f8f9701b4c5aee88ca236b59fca.poster.avif?t=1786072996\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/55217f8f9701b4c5aee88ca236b59fca.webm?t=1786072996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/55217f8f9701b4c5aee88ca236b59fca.mp4?t=1786072996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >酸雨侵蚀作物，烈日炙烤大地，雷暴轮番来袭。但灾害也可以为你所用：收集雷电驱动农场，借暴雨浇灌田地。推进环境改造，让恶劣天气一步步退场，直到荒野重新开花。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏内包含30+小时的核心玩法，采集、种植、建造、钓鱼、畜牧一应俱全；还有上百小时的延伸内容，镇民羁绊、节日庆典、无人机战斗、基因改造、自动化生产与家园装扮。让玩家能够从勤劳的拾荒者，一步步发展为坐等收成的农场主！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/fefeb9175e1e8bae562fb67f9c454474.avif?t=1786072996\" width=1170 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/b7fea055b4fda108984ec414d0188706.poster.avif?t=1786072996\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/b7fea055b4fda108984ec414d0188706.webm?t=1786072996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/b7fea055b4fda108984ec414d0188706.mp4?t=1786072996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>采集：</strong>游戏中有超40种末日世界观下的矿物、植物、旧废料等资源供玩家获取。 在这里，垃圾也有它的用处。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>种植：</strong>自给自足是末世农场的基础。制作种植盆、播种、浇水、收割，并在恶劣天气中为作物提供保护，组成了末世种田的日常。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>建造：</strong>在农场自由堆叠平台，把家园一层层搭向天空，攀爬跳跃之间创造更多生存与种植空间。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/ff3c089f023533ae8a3b931817fcd919.poster.avif?t=1786072996\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/ff3c089f023533ae8a3b931817fcd919.webm?t=1786072996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/ff3c089f023533ae8a3b931817fcd919.mp4?t=1786072996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>钓鱼：</strong>钓鱼则是另一种生存方式。不同的池塘、鱼竿、天气都会有别样的收获，在末世中做个钓鱼佬或许也是一种不错的选择。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>畜牧：</strong>搭建畜棚、放置围栏，从喂食、清洁到收获副产品，每一个环节都充满期待和疗愈。新鲜的奶、营养的蛋将成为你末日生存的重要补给。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>基因系统：</strong>找回末世前遗失的科技，对30余种作物进行基因改造，让作物拥有更顽强的生命力，或是赋予作物更奇妙的特性。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>自动化种田：</strong>利用太阳能与风能发电，搭建农用无人机平台，解锁无人机播种、养护、采集的全自动化流水线，实现躺着种田的梦想。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/59d9138ec0dbbc2e322ebc204ad12194.avif?t=1786072996\" width=1170 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >自由探索是多洛可中必不可少的部分。从复杂多变的郊外、野蛮生长的河谷、危机四伏的湿地，到神秘莫测的洞穴与渺无人烟的旧城废墟，每片区域都藏着独特的资源、敌人与故事。随着游戏的推进，玩家将前往更多未知领域，开启一段充满故事的冒险。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/d9cc433b618c83e1857df0193e045b65.poster.avif?t=1786072996\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/d9cc433b618c83e1857df0193e045b65.webm?t=1786072996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/d9cc433b618c83e1857df0193e045b65.mp4?t=1786072996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在探索的路上，不仅要记下来时的路，以防在天黑前无法赶回家；还要时刻警惕散落在野外废墟中的危险生物和敌人！为你的无人机升级、加装武器模块、照明模块，方可让每一次探索都化险为夷。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >除了地图探索，小镇的秘密也是一大值得寻味的乐趣。为何河谷能在末日之中保持枝繁叶茂？为何小镇传奇领袖离奇失踪？为何各种末日前遗失的科技都留有“伊甸园”的名字？和小镇上的居民们一起寻觅，日常诙谐剧情背后的秘密。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/ace1b3c40faa0ab02453a6a4ffca8950.avif?t=1786072996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras_big/ace1b3c40faa0ab02453a6a4ffca8950.webp?t=1786072996 width=1560 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/e937027df80cf1dedd512b2ab6cd4b87.poster.avif?t=1786072996\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/e937027df80cf1dedd512b2ab6cd4b87.webm?t=1786072996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/e937027df80cf1dedd512b2ab6cd4b87.mp4?t=1786072996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拜访多洛可小镇上的每一位镇民，耕耘友谊，收获羁绊。其中 13 位镇民拥有专属好感剧情，用心相处，建立羁绊，才能读到每个人背后的故事。同时，在这个末世中的世外桃源，人们仍然庆祝着“旧世界”的节日：佳节到来，张灯结彩，参加一系列活动，和镇民们一同制作节庆道具，深化来之不易的情谊，在艰苦的末世中收获治愈和快乐。</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/4bc7a0e18828976601330b12641670041c8fd3cb/header_alt_assets_1_schinese.jpg?t=1786072996","website":"","developers":["RedSaw Games Studio"],"publishers":["Logoi Games","Pathea Games"],"release_date":"2026 年 8 月 5 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"19.99","final":"15.99","discount":20},"supported_languages":"英语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 法语, 德语, 日语, 韩语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 俄语","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","Steam 创意工坊","视角舒适度","可选颜色","自定义音量控制","无需应对快速反应事件","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","部分支持控制器","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["冒险","休闲","独立","角色扮演","模拟"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel i3 6100<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 2 GB 可用空间</li></ul>","recommended":""},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/998d632ad2708a94a108b72eabbdd318c690c28b/ss_998d632ad2708a94a108b72eabbdd318c690c28b.600x338.jpg?t=1786072996","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/998d632ad2708a94a108b72eabbdd318c690c28b/ss_998d632ad2708a94a108b72eabbdd318c690c28b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786072996"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/39b48b0d7ceb343c03e3b305918d1a555f563ca7/ss_39b48b0d7ceb343c03e3b305918d1a555f563ca7.600x338.jpg?t=1786072996","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/39b48b0d7ceb343c03e3b305918d1a555f563ca7/ss_39b48b0d7ceb343c03e3b305918d1a555f563ca7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786072996"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/7e64bd530394d53d68337e2be4de09bed6120a4b/ss_7e64bd530394d53d68337e2be4de09bed6120a4b.600x338.jpg?t=1786072996","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/7e64bd530394d53d68337e2be4de09bed6120a4b/ss_7e64bd530394d53d68337e2be4de09bed6120a4b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786072996"}]}